      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='80' font-size='34' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Weekly Account Audit</text><rect x='100' y='140' width='280' height='200' rx='14' fill='#6366f1' opacity='0.2' stroke='#6366f1' stroke-width='2'/><text x='240' y='185' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Work</text><text x='240' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Balance: ?</text><rect x='410' y='140' width='280' height='200' rx='14' fill='#10b981' opacity='0.2' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='185' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Home</text><text x='550' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Balance: ?</text><rect x='720' y='140' width='280' height='200' rx='14' fill='#ef4444' opacity='0.2' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><text x='860' y='185' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Strained</text><text x='860' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Balance: Low</text><text x='550' y='420' font-size='22' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Pick the lowest, choose one deposit</text><rect x='150' y='470' width='800' height='60' rx='10' fill='#f59e0b' opacity='0.25' stroke='#f59e0b'/><text x='550' y='508' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Ask what matters to them specifically</text><rect x='150' y='550' width='800' height='60' rx='10' fill='#0ea5e9' opacity='0.25' stroke='#0ea5e9'/><text x='550' y='588' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Keep one small promise consistently</text><rect x='150' y='630' width='800' height='60' rx='10' fill='#8b5cf6' opacity='0.25' stroke='#8b5cf6'/><text x='550' y='668' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Give a specific, non-defensive apology</text><text x='550' y='760' font-size='18' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Log one deposit or withdrawal daily for four weeks</text></svg>",
